em \"Express $-\\\\frac{3}{4}+\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\cos^2\\\\left(\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{10}\\\\right)$ as a single trigonometric ratio.\"] [:db/add \"3be3d0e9-e756-582a-9202-db325353b0cf\" :question/worked-solution \"Collect the common factor:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\n&-\\\\frac{3}{4}+\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\cos^2\\\\left(\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{10}\\\\right)\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(2\\\\cos^2\\\\left(\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{10}\\\\right)-1\\\\right)\\n\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the alternative cosine double-angle formula:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\cos^2 x-1=\\\\cos(2x)\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute $x=\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{10}$:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\n2\\\\cos^2\\\\left(\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{10}\\\\right)-1&=\\\\cos\\\\left(2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{10}\\\\right)\\\\\\\\&=\\\\cos\\\\left(\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{5}\\\\right)\\n\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nKeep the outside factor:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(2\\\\cos^2\\\\left(\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{10}\\\\right)-1\\\\right)&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\cos\\\\left(\\\\frac{13\\\\pi}{5}\\\\right)\\n\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"3be3d0e9-e756-582a-9202-db325353b0cf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"3be3d0e9-e756-582a-9202-db325353b0cf\" :question/answer-fields \"6aec1210-7a90-5b22-9759-ec0b42453962\"] [:db/ensure \"3be3d0e9-e756-582a-9202-db325353b0cf\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186087670 :knowledge-point/questions \"3be3d0e9-e756-582a-9202-db325353b0cf\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"62638cbb-45b8-581d-b053-bfa1a706b4d0\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/a8/a80b0538916854ad40cecff9bdbb690592668cc1993e902eff22dd772721ba77/generator.py\"] [:db/add 17592186087670 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"] [:db/ensure 17592186087670 :knowledge-point/validate]] \"assertions\" [[\"5456fd4a-9d2b-5ef9-882b-9eca093d31d1\" :answer/id #uuid \"5456fd4a-9d2b-5ef9-882b-9eca093d31d1\"] [\"5456fd4a-9d2b-5ef9-882b-9eca093d31d1\" :answer/type :an